        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سورج (sūraj) is usually traced to Sanskrit sūrya, \"sun\". CDIAL lists that word, but no Hindi or Urdu form under it (CDIAL 13574)."
